commit: (git not used)
bug: file_editor_cm6 LSP bridge crashes: FrameworkShellManager missing get_pipe_state; adopted pipe shells cannot be reused
summary: CM6 LSP Socket.IO bridge expects pipe-backed shells and calls mgr.get_pipe_state(shell.id); manager lacked method after module split; additionally LSP shell reuse via label across restarts returns records without live pipe handles.
fix: added FrameworkShellManager.get_pipe_state(shell_id) returning live PipeState; updated lsp_shell_manager to only reuse running shells when live pipe state exists, otherwise terminate and respawn.
