commit: (git not used)
bugs: IPC killed on Ctrl+C; /api/apps/running returned 422
summary: Ctrl+C previously killed IPC immediately via bash trap, racing shutdown. Also FastAPI Depends(get_manager) treated **kwargs as query param, producing 422.
fix: Added /actions/exit (sleep listener + main IPC) to sleep supervisor then self-exit; updated run_framework.sh trap to call /actions/exit and wait before last-resort termination; wrapped framework_shells.get_manager with a no-kwargs dependency to fix 422 on /api/apps/running (and lock/quit/unlock).
files: app/ipc/server.py, scripts/run_framework.sh, app/extensions/apps/main.py

